      "content": "uugh okay i hear you on the water thing but i'm worried if i keep running water it'll eventually just feel cold and then it'll hurt more once it dries. my mom always said putting a thick layer of butter or even some heavy antibiotic ointment on it right away helps seal it so it doesnt get irritated by the air. wouldn't that be safer than just leaving it exposed and wet?",
